      "knownFor": "An Edosian Starfleet lieutenant and USS Enterprise navigator, voiced by James Doohan in Star Trek: The Animated Series.",
      "reveal": "The frozen Arex source names James Doohan as the primary actor and states that Arex’s voice was provided by James Doohan. This supports Doohan’s primary voice-only performance as Arex in Star Trek: The Animated Series (1973–74), reconciled to the existing Lieutenant Arex record at UC-684 rather than creating a duplicate card. Carlos Alazraqui’s later Very Short Treks performance remains separate, as do M’Ress, Agmar, Aleek-Om, the Guardian of Forever, Kor, Koloth, Korax, and Doohan’s other roles. The exact role-specific Arex still is retained as character evidence, while a separately sourced public-domain photograph supports Doohan’s identity. The former generic Filmation designer field is removed because the frozen role evidence does not name an exact animator, character designer, voice director, editor, sound-processing contributor, vocal-transformation practitioner, production shop, or other maker for this performance.",
